                    <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-red-700 mb-3">Cons</p>
                    <ul class="space-y-2">
                      <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-red-800"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>Latex acrylic durability — scuffs under heavy traffic</li>
